          {
            "content": "【审计回写】建议仅提醒继续推进，未见外部依赖或阻塞证据",
            "type": "system",
            "timestamp": "2025-01-03T00:00:00Z"
          }
        ]
      },
      "expected_result": {
        "should_mismatch": false,
        "category": null,
        "recommended_status": null
      },
      "historical_wrong_behavior": "system/audit 评论被当成真实 blocker/decision 语义，拦截正常 dispatch。"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "implementation-current-context-phrase-ignored",
      "ticket": {
        "status": "running",
        "comments": [
          {
            "content": "实现时请优先修正 current context 选择逻辑，并展示 context latest active time",
            "type": "progress",
            "timestamp": "2025-01-03T00:00:00Z"
          }
        ]
      },
      "expected_result": {
        "should_mismatch": false,
        "category": null,
        "recommended_status": null
      },
      "historical_wrong_behavior": "普通实现说明里的 current context/上下文 被误判成 context_gap。"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "real-context-gap-still-detected",
      "ticket": {
        "status": "running",
        "comments": [
          {
            "content": "token 不够用了，上下文不足，需要更多信息",
            "type": "blocker",
            "timestamp": "2025-01-02T00:00:00Z"
          }
        ]
      },
      "expected_result": {
        "should_mismatch": true,
        "category": "context_gap",
        "recommended_status": "review"
      },
      "historical_wrong_behavior": "规则收紧过头会把真实 context gap 也漏掉，导致 reviewer 看不到应转 review 的单。"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "real-external-blocked-still-detected",
      "ticket": {
        "status": "running",
        "comments": [
          {
            "content": "等外部 API 权限，依赖 ops 审批",
            "type": "blocker",
            "timestamp": "2025-01-02T00:00:00Z"
          }
        ]
      },
      "expected_result": {
        "should_mismatch": true,
        "category": "external_blocked",
        "recommended_status": "blocked"
      },
      "historical_wrong_behavior": "workflow_mismatch 规则改动若回退或误删，可能让真实外部阻塞不再被识别。"
    }
  ],
  "historical_wrong_behavior": [
    "system/audit 评论被当成真实阻塞语义，导致 running dispatch 被误抑制。",
    "普通实现说明里的 current context / 上下文 文案被误判为 context_gap，历史 stuck 单无法恢复正常派发。"
